## Usage Examples

### Default Behavior (same as before)
```bash
python 4d_tcn_mel_64x300.py --warmup_epochs 50 --dropout 0.3
# Uses random_seed=42, split=75/10/15
```

### Custom Random Seed
```bash
python 4d_tcn_mel_64x300.py --random_seed 123
# Different data split, different weight initialization
```

### Reproduce Specific Run
```bash
# From training report, see "Random Seed: 42"
python 4d_tcn_mel_64x300.py --random_seed 42 --dropout 0.3 --tcn_channels 64
# Exact reproduction of previous run
```

### Ensemble Training (different seeds)
```bash
# Train 5 models with different random seeds
for seed in 42 100 200 300 400; do
    python 4d_tcn_mel_64x300.py --random_seed $seed --dropout 0.3
done
# Average predictions for ensemble
```

