## Validation

The split ratios can be verified with a simple test:
```python
# Example with 1000 samples
# Test: 1000 * 0.15 = 150 samples
# Remaining: 850 samples
# Val: 850 * (0.10 / 0.85) = 850 * 0.1176 = 100 samples
# Train: 850 - 100 = 750 samples

# Verification:
# Train: 750/1000 = 75.0% ✓
# Val: 100/1000 = 10.0% ✓
# Test: 150/1000 = 15.0% ✓
```

The script also displays actual percentages to verify:
```
✓ Train: 4500 (75.0%) | Val: 600 (10.0%) | Test: 900 (15.0%)
```

