   TEST_RATIO = 0.15
   VAL_RATIO = 0.1275  # 15% of remaining 85%
   TRAIN_RATIO = 0.7225
   ```

**Recommendation**: Use new 75/10/15 split - it's optimal based on 7c analysis.

